WEBVTT

00:00:58.763 --> 00:01:03.197
And she licensed this actually to women
like herself from poor backgrounds with

00:01:03.197 --> 00:01:05.430
relatively little formal education.

00:01:05.997 --> 00:01:09.763
Now, there are many stories like that of
entrepreneurs who did things differently.

00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:15.663
Take on Chesky, co-founder of 23, and me,
Jack Ma, co-founder of Alibaba.

00:01:15.697 --> 00:01:18.330
Jackie Novogratz, who launched
the Acumen Fund.

00:01:18.663 --> 00:01:24.097
Bill Gates, Steve Jobs, Elizabeth Arden,
Elon Musk. There's so many now.

00:01:24.097 --> 00:01:26.563
It's intimidating to look
at those stories.

00:01:27.063 --> 00:01:31.130
But what if we could all be a little
bit more like them now?